{"v":4,"catch":"STEP THEATERへようこそ！","desc":"舞台はとある映画館。\n音楽に合わせた操作で、上映されるさまざまな物語を進めます。\nプレイを進めると新たなステージが登場し、舞台や楽曲、キャラクターのアクションも変化。\nシンプルな操作と、キュートなアニメーション、ポップな楽曲が組み合わさり、遊んでも見ていても楽しめます。","publisher":"エヌビーゲームズ","release":"2026-12-03","genres":["音樂","動作"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["日本語","英語","中国語 (簡体字)","中国語 (繁体字)"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"3+","size":"Switch 2 3.3GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f325dbe82c328d2dc33737b011e56d5d14b8a538177fc59214c6827787377732.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0bca67d733fdf99f3184de9271e43b0a6f9c1a0085c04960a542b9674e756fc9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/f3914fcc9e71dd6df696f1976b3216ff077116843275ea6f7d9ae2d37c9f0e48.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e939d6d872cd4b064a4bbb0f80947725ffa29d8997ed364162c29384c5aa7abd.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/79238f9281565409ac680c96cd36c31190ebfa48ce8e83661e99e1426645a228.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/a11b9e916e98aa31da8865b2d7bfd915399c05a9db169568f99ed654210bfd3f.jpg"],"titleId":"040033c02a002000"}